Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Update header comment to reference dsh-teams-x (teamsx_* tool set)
- Replace tool-agent-team row with dsh-teams-x row (memberProvider, memberModel, maxMembers)
- Rewrite Agent Teams persona section to reflect teamsx_* protocol:
  - captain protocol: create → add_member → create_task DAG → ask_user_question → approve
  - Evidence-first discipline: analyze before invoking any teamsx tool
  - Team rules: captain-only operations, claim/update_task with attempt_id, quality contracts
  - Stopping (teamsx_delete) aborts captain's turn; only explicit user turn resumes
- Remove all references to old experimental agent-team tools
  (spawn_teammate, send_message, team_task_*, wait_agent, list_agents)
---
